# frontend/*.html ship their JS embedded in a single <script> tag with
# no build step, by design (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Running Prettier's
# HTML parser across ~4,000 lines of already-shipped, heavily-tested
# production markup+script would produce a single enormous diff with
# no way to verify each change is safe — see pyproject.toml's
# equivalent reasoning for why `ruff format` isn't enforced either.
frontend/*.html
CHANGELOG.md
